@@ -535,5 +539,125 @@
       <summary>Graphics rendering mode</summary>
       <description>auto, hardware or software. Software is a safe fallback for GPUs whose driver crashes the hardware renderer.</description>
     </key>
+    <key name="sensors-gpu-zone" type="s">
+      <default>"TZGT"</default>
+      <summary>Sensor treated as GPU</summary>
+      <description>Overrides GPU detection for hardware the driver-name heuristic misses. Matched against the hwmon chip name or thermal zone type. Upstream this should default to empty; NCZ-OS defaults it to TZGT because the CIX Sky1 graphics thermal zone carries no name a generic heuristic can recognise.</description>
