+        a 0-8 spin control (desktop_page.vala) and the compositor clamps to the
+        same range (main.vala), so the range mirrors both.
+      </description>
+    </key>
+    <key name="tiling-gap" type="i">
+      <default>8</default>
+      <range min="0" max="64"/>
+      <summary>Window gap</summary>
+      <description>
+        Space in pixels between windows in scrolling tiling. UI spin range and
+        the tiling_manager clamp are both 0-64. Read only when the sidebar or
+        the tiling manager runs, so it was a second abort queued behind
